<title>UK: Daimler-Benz unit sets $150 mln bond.</title>
<headline>Daimler-Benz unit sets $150 mln bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Commerzbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DAIMLER-BENZ NORTH AMERICA CORP</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  DAIMLER-BENZ AG</p>
<p> AMT    $150 MLN	COUPON     6.625     MATURITY    21.APR.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.10    PAY DATE    21.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    99.95     SPREAD	+15 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	A1	  LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A+	  DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.225     SELL CONC  1.15	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
